# x86_64 baseline of the final hardening code.
# Measured locally with scripts/check-sizes.sh on the reference desktop,
# built from commit 420a714 (clean tree), rustc 1.98.1 from
# rust-toolchain.toml, release profile (fat LTO, codegen-units=1,
# panic=abort, strip). Later commits on the branch change only tests,
# scripts and docs, no shipped source. A second build after touching the
# sources gave the same sha256, so the build is reproducible in place.
# The native x86_64 CI runner builds the same code (commit 431d8df, run
# 40895881758) to inacircle 1103200 / 839096 and inacircle-text 695048 /
# 397298, a few bytes apart from the local build (cause not analysed).
# The per-area account of the growth over the Plan 7 baseline
# (inacircle 900352 671864) is in docs/benchmarks/binary-size.md.
inacircle 1103168 839112
inacircle-text 695000 397314
